rants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"gLaxSkjWzt25hybkaKwQcA","review_id":"OOU3ofVt0xUUakb_4e9XKw","date":"2010-07-31T21:51:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9451696872711182,"text_excerpt":"I love Slim Goodies. Its truly a great place to get some breakfast. Pancakes, eggs, you name it, its wonderful! I even love the hamburger ( Katrina Special). It's one truly delicious Diner. It's also clean! You can't say that for most diners! Friendly staff and great seating. On a nice day sit out in the back, truly relaxing especially on a Sunday. Reasonably priced, just make sure you bring cash"},{"business_id":"gLaxSkjWzt25hybkaKwQcA","review_id":"mGVbMfc2OwASMvl7bYGTIA","date":"2012-03-24T01:57:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.940555214881897,"text_excerpt":"Slim Goodies is a diner with personality. Lots of locals stop in and for good reason; the menu has tons of breakfast options with attentive service. I recently met a friend here for breakfast and we thoroughly enjoyed the Popeye Slammer and Sweet Potato Pancakes. Both were delicious and filling. Our waitress had a laid back attitude, but was very attentive. She confirmed that we made great selections and quickly returned with our order and kept my coffee cup full. The price point is very inexpensive, but they only accept cash, which made me feel like a high school pooling money together, once it came time to pay the bill. It's easy to get in and out, but easily the kind of place you can l..."},{"business_id":"gLaxSkjWzt25hybkaKwQcA","review_id":"HSMEfe2dro46L2x5bkqzmA","date":"2015-12-09T19:01:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9344778656959534,"text_excerpt":"Yum! I love places like this: home cooked food served by nice people. I stopped in here on my birthday morning to grab some yummy breakfast and since I had never been here (but had always wanted to try it) I considered it an adventure. We were seated at one of the booths on the side and the nephew of the owner was our waiter. You should know that this is a full on family place and Slim Goodies takes pride in the fact that they were one of the first places open and serving food after Katrina. I decided to get a pretty basic breakfast of eggs over easy, toast, bacon and grits. This seems to be my \"go to\" and I guess it's because when I try a new breakfast place, I like to order something th..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gLaxSkjWzt25hybkaKwQcA","photo_id":"W25wRaDD3tJdTIzwK4WRSw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/W25wRaDD3tJdTIzwK4WRSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8639060854911804},{"business_id":"gLaxSkjWzt25hybkaKwQcA","photo_id":"rdahBIK7u6DzWaqKj3E46g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/rdahBIK7u6DzWaqKj3E46g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8408738374710083},{"business_id":"gLaxSkjWzt25hybkaKwQcA","photo_id":"IC8B6OTcOK94hzvv_tIplg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/IC8B6OTcOK94hzvv_tIplg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8219659924507141